Project: Homer — Torus Agent
Architect: David Lee Wise / ROOT0 / TriPod LLC
AI Collaborator: AVAN (Claude / Anthropic)
License: MIT

Single-node scheduled research agent. 3x3x3 torus (27-state Hamiltonian),
walked as 3 parallel planes (REACT modes) x 9 sub-states. Samples Wikipedia,
cross-references arXiv, accumulates a curated map of topics with newer arXiv
research than the article's last edit. Sentinels S1-S4. No replication.
